This licence covers the source code only.

It does NOT cover the artwork: the painted scenes, the poster, the app icon and
every image derived from them, wherever they appear in this repository. That
includes, without being limited to, art/sources, public/images, public/plates,
public/icons, public/favicon.svg, the generated Android launcher and splash
resources under android/app/src/main/res, and the screenshots and screen
recording in docs/images.

These images were produced with an image-generation model from written briefs,
so how much copyright subsists in them is genuinely unsettled. To the extent any
rights subsist, they are reserved. Beyond that, the request is simply this:
please read the code, build the app and run it, but do not lift the artwork into
your own work. Ask first and the answer will probably be yes.

It does NOT cover the bundled audio in public/audio, which is licensed from
Kevin MacLeod under CC BY 4.0. See MUSIC-LICENSES.md for the attribution terms
you must keep if you redistribute it.

Map geography is Natural Earth public-domain data and fonts are under the SIL
Open Font License; both are recorded in THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md.
